lling suggests a Republican favorite by mid-single digits, with meaningful uncertainty given the thin and partisan polling record.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.2515, "margin": -3.92}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2605, "margin": -4.5}]}